PostgreSQL

Admin Report APIs:
| Feature              | Endpoint                                      |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| KPI cards            | `GET /api/admin/reports/overview`             |
| Centre performance   | `GET /api/admin/reports/centre-performance`   |
| Attendance by centre | `GET /api/admin/reports/attendance-by-centre` |
| Dropout trend        | `GET /api/admin/reports/dropout-trends`       |
| Subject satisfaction | `GET /api/admin/reports/subject-satisfaction` |
| Top students         | `GET /api/admin/reports/top-students`         |
| All students         | `GET /api/admin/reports/students`             |
| Export top students  | `GET /api/admin/reports/export/top-students`  |
| Export all students  | `GET /api/admin/reports/export/students`      |


